foundation.question_text:
A $1$ m vertical stick casts a shadow $2$ m long. At the same time a tree casts a shadow $8$ m long. Find the height of the tree.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (0,1.2);
\draw (0,0) -- (2.4,0) node[midway,below] {$8\text{ m}$};
\draw (2.4,0) -- (0,1.2);
\node[left] at (0,0.6) {$h$};
\draw (3.4,0) -- (3.4,0.3);
\draw (3.4,0) -- (4.0,0) node[midway,below] {$2\text{ m}$};
\draw (4.0,0) -- (3.4,0.3);
\node[left] at (3.4,0.15) {$1\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

