development.question_text:
A light pole has a globe $6$ m above the ground. A boy stands $10$ m from the base of the pole and casts a shadow $2$ m long. Find the height of the boy.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (0.7,0) node[midway,below] {$2\text{ m}$};
\draw (0.7,0) -- (4.2,0) node[midway,below] {$10\text{ m}$};
\draw (0,0) -- (4.2,2.1);
\draw (0.7,0) -- (0.7,0.35);
\draw (4.2,0) -- (4.2,2.1) node[midway,right] {$6\text{ m}$};
\node[left] at (0.7,0.2) {$h$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

