A person $1.6$ m tall and an $8$ m flagpole cast shadows at the same time. The flagpole's shadow is $6$ m longer than the person's shadow. Find the length of the person's shadow.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (0,0.448);
\draw (0,0) -- (0.42,0) node[midway,below] {$d$};
\draw (0.42,0) -- (0,0.448);
\node[left] at (0,0.224) {$1.6\text{ m}$};
\draw (3.0,0) -- (3.0,2.24);
\draw (3.0,0) -- (5.1,0) node[midway,below] {$d+6$};
\draw (5.1,0) -- (3.0,2.24);
\node[left] at (3.0,1.12) {$8\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
